      "exactQuote": "The European Commission's new proposal builds on previous targets and roadmaps, representing a significant step towards enshrining the 2040 target in law.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-5"
    },
    {
      "text": "In July 2021, the European Climate Law officially entered into force.",
      "exactQuote": "In July 2021, the European Climate Law officially entered into force, setting a target of a net GHG reduction of at least 55% by 2030, compared to 1990 levels.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "The European Climate Law set a target of a net GHG reduction of at least 55% by 2030, compared to 1990 levels.",
      "exactQuote": "In July 2021, the European Climate Law officially entered into force, setting a target of a net GHG reduction of at least 55% by 2030, compared to 1990 levels.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "In 2024, the commission published an impact assessment detailing the underlying qualitative analysis it had undertaken around emissions reduction targets for 2040.",
      "exactQuote": "In 2024, the commission published an impact assessment, detailing the underlying qualitative analysis it had undertaken around emissions reduction targets for 2040.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-7"
    },
    {
      "text": "The impact assessment, together with the European Scientific Advisory Board on Climate Change's report and advice from the UN's Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change, formed the basis for the 90% target.",
      "exactQuote": "This, together with the European Scientific Advisory Board on Climate Change's report and advice from the UN's Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change, formed the basis for the 90% target.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-7"
    },
    {
      "text": "The headline 90% target for 2040 was announced as part of a roadmap outlined by the commission in February 2024.",
      "exactQuote": "The headline 90% target for 2040 was announced as part of a roadmap outlined by the commission in February 2024.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposal would require emissions to fall to 'less than' 850m tonnes of CO2e.",
      "exactQuote": "The proposal would require emissions to fall to \"less than\" 850m tonnes of CO2e, with \"up to\" 400MtCO2e removed from the atmosphere.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposal would require 'up to' 400MtCO2e removed from the atmosphere.",
      "exactQuote": "The proposal would require emissions to fall to \"less than\" 850m tonnes of CO2e, with \"up to\" 400MtCO2e removed from the atmosphere.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "The flexibility that has received the most attention is to allow limited use of international carbon credits, under Article 6 of the Paris Agreement, starting in 2036.",
      "exactQuote": "Of these, the one that has received the most attention is to allow limited use of international carbon credits, under Article 6 of the Paris Agreement, starting in 2036.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "This flexibility means that emissions within the EU would only need to fall to 87% below 1990 levels by 2040, with the remaining 3% taking place overseas.",
      "exactQuote": "In effect, this flexibility means that emissions within the EU would only need to fall to 87% below 1990 levels by 2040, with the remaining 3% taking place overseas.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "The European Scientific Advisory Board on Climate Change stated that the EU should not count such credits towards the 2040 target.",
      "exactQuote": "In an unusual intervention that coincided with the proposal itself, the European Scientific Advisory Board on Climate Change stated that the EU should not count such credits towards the 2040 target.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-13"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Advisory Board said: 'Using international carbon credits to meet this target, even partially, could undermine domestic value creation by diverting resources from the necessary transformation of the EU's economy.'",
      "exactQuote": "It said: 'Using international carbon credits to meet this target, even partially, could undermine domestic value creation by diverting resources from the necessary transformation of the EU's economy.'",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-13"
    },
    {
      "text": "Certain European countries have been placing pressure on the commission to change or adapt the 2040 target, slowing the progress of this week's proposal, which had been due out in February.",
      "exactQuote": "Certain European countries have been placing pressure on the commission to change or adapt the 2040 target, slowing the progress of this week's proposal, which had been due out in February.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-15"
    },
    {
      "text": "Italy called for the goal to be weakened.",
      "exactQuote": "For example, Italy called for the goal to be weakened and France asked for 'flexibility' to be introduced.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-15"
    },
    {
      "text": "France asked for 'flexibility' to be introduced.",
      "exactQuote": "For example, Italy called for the goal to be weakened and France asked for 'flexibility' to be introduced.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-15"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it stands, the EU is not on track to achieve the 2030 target.",
      "exactQuote": "As it stands, the EU is not on track to achieve this [2030] target.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-17"
    },
    {
      "text": "Current projections suggest that, even if all planned climate policies are implemented, the bloc's emissions are set to fall 48% by 2030, rather than 55%.",
      "exactQuote": "Current projections suggest that, even if all planned climate policies are implemented, the bloc's emissions are set to fall 48% by 2030, rather than 55%.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-003#block-17"
    }
  ]
